WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.340
Good evening, everybody, and welcome to the rec centre!

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:08.140
Kilnworth Embers in orange, Fernwick Frost in white. Decent crowd in tonight.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.040
Ball's up, and we're under way.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.100
Okafor, in the corner... Bang! Three!

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.140
Adeyemi picks his pocket! All the way... oh, he throws it down!

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.680
Frost come right back. Easy two at the other end.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.480
Baptiste says no! Get that out of here!

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.000
The Embers bench enjoying that one.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:49.310
Listen to this place! And a reminder, the snack bar is open at the break.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.570
Reyes, step back... got it!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:00.870
Okafor, from deep, for the win... Bang! Embers win it! Unbelievable!

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:02.870
They're all over him!

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:08.040
Long night for both sides. Legs getting heavy now.
